WEBVTT

00:01:58.447 --> 00:02:01.284
So I was really inspired by her actions,

00:02:01.325 --> 00:02:04.787
and I decided that I would start
striking as well.

00:02:05.163 --> 00:02:08.875
However, I was quite scared
to go to the street.

00:02:09.876 --> 00:02:11.669
MR: Why were you scared?

00:02:11.711 --> 00:02:16.716
VN: I think I've always been nervous
to face people, so many people.

00:02:16.757 --> 00:02:18.092
MR: Are you a bit shy?

00:02:18.134 --> 00:02:19.677
VN: A bit, yes.

00:02:20.219 --> 00:02:25.975
Yeah, but I tend
to manage it, I should say.

00:02:26.017 --> 00:02:28.728
MR: You were in Davos with Greta Thunberg

00:02:28.728 --> 00:02:31.564
and some other well-known
climate activists.